                "entry_id": "7b77ed6b-4ac8-3a89-a31e-614bcf580c4b",
                "word": "binnenwippen",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bd45a0b8-6b8e-38d4-97cd-a17b5d47b4a7",
                        "entry_id": "7b77ed6b-4ac8-3a89-a31e-614bcf580c4b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "op een informele wijze ergens een kort bezoekje afleggen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8fb40c0c-e301-4cac-9922-c728ae9b0626",
                                "sense_id": "bd45a0b8-6b8e-38d4-97cd-a17b5d47b4a7",
                                "text": "Even binnenwippen bij een ambtenaar in het gemeentehuis is een moeilijke zaak. De 'veiligheidsmaatregelen' bezorgen de raadsleden het gevoel dat het makkelijker is om opheldering te vragen via schriftelijke vragen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76f7237e-bb3d-4d56-a722-e5e87b67e3bd",
                                "sense_id": "bd45a0b8-6b8e-38d4-97cd-a17b5d47b4a7",
                                "text": "\"Bij diploma-uitreikingen en jubilea, dan is de burgemeester er altijd. Daar maakt hij tijd voor vrij\", zegt brandweercommandant Jan Harbers. \"Soms komt hij 's avonds even binnenwippen in de kazerne, gewoon om een praatje te maken. Dat toont aan dat hij de brandweer onder zijn hart draagt. Bort Koelwijn is echt een mens in zijn functie.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b2e450e-4dc0-479f-b094-d278f93193c0",
                                "sense_id": "bd45a0b8-6b8e-38d4-97cd-a17b5d47b4a7",
                                "text": ",,Ik woon ver weg in Sydney, dus ik kan af en toe even binnenwippen in de filmwereld en weer ontsnappen."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3b25f6af-b3bb-4809-9485-c9c4586590b7",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b77ed6b-4ac8-3a89-a31e-614bcf580c4b",
                        "source_sense_id": "bd45a0b8-6b8e-38d4-97cd-a17b5d47b4a7",
                        "source_sense_description": "op een informele wijze ergens een kort bezoekje afleggen",
                        "target_lang_word": "drop in",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "drop in",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "939f18c3-df1a-33df-8587-f0471ad900a6",
                                        "entry_id": "a58344e6-c9a8-31e6-906d-e8dd26a9ec93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see drop, in."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f31379c-8178-458b-8f70-af4e16b0f259",
                                                "sense_id": "939f18c3-df1a-33df-8587-f0471ad900a6",
                                                "text": "The keys were dropped in the fishbowl."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fbe1713c-616d-3ac6-bd25-2275c0dacac2",
                                        "entry_id": "a58344e6-c9a8-31e6-906d-e8dd26a9ec93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To arrive casually and unannounced, with little or no warning; also, to visit without an appointment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "587c7198-72dc-41f5-b8bf-38421b1578e7",
                                                "sense_id": "fbe1713c-616d-3ac6-bd25-2275c0dacac2",
                                                "text": "I was in the garden covered with mud when my grandmother dropped in for a visit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b07b5786-876e-4fce-9edc-c423171e0a10",
                                                "sense_id": "fbe1713c-616d-3ac6-bd25-2275c0dacac2",
                                                "text": "We made an odd party before the arrival of the Ten, particularly when the Celebrity dropped in for lunch or dinner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e8977e1-175a-4525-9826-da1550d46ab9",
                                                "sense_id": "fbe1713c-616d-3ac6-bd25-2275c0dacac2",
                                                "text": "And so you felt like droppin’ in and just expect me to be free / Well, now I'm saving all my lovin’ for someone who's lovin’ me"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "524bdab0-74ee-3c57-805f-9039b264e35e",
                                        "entry_id": "a58344e6-c9a8-31e6-906d-e8dd26a9ec93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To paddle into and take off on a wave another surfer is already riding."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77b55f4d-ace3-4d57-9989-5395b1fbd16f",
                                                "sense_id": "524bdab0-74ee-3c57-805f-9039b264e35e",
                                                "text": "Most beginners are blissfully unaware that dropping in on someone is a cardinal sin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d8b5235-27a7-3cb5-9f1f-daf105a60630",
                                        "entry_id": "a58344e6-c9a8-31e6-906d-e8dd26a9ec93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To fall in; to cave in."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "072b68d2-6b78-4698-8a41-cd4eede14027",
                                                "sense_id": "4d8b5235-27a7-3cb5-9f1f-daf105a60630",
                                                "text": "⁠The cheeks drop in; the body bows;\nMan dies: nor is there hope in dust: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31713c47-0ae0-32d5-86c6-41fc91c5416b",
                                        "entry_id": "a58344e6-c9a8-31e6-906d-e8dd26a9ec93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To install components, particularly car engines."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c20b2810-b013-42d5-9c08-c63bbdcf8a2c",
                                                "sense_id": "31713c47-0ae0-32d5-86c6-41fc91c5416b",
                                                "text": "We dropped in all-new parts in the sports car."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
